 nityānanda rāy","abhimāna-śūnya nitāi nagare beḍāy"],"translation":["The great personality, Lord Nityānanda Prabhu, is free from anger and full of transcendental ecstasy. He wanders throughout the towns, free from false pride and arrogance."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["adhama patita jīver dvāre dvāre giyā","harināma mahāmantra dena bilāiyā"],"translation":["He travels from door to door to the homes of the fallen souls, freely distributing the Hare Krishna mahāmantra."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["jāre dekhe tāre kohe dante tṛṇa kori","āmāre kiniyā loho bhaja gaurahari"],"translation":["With straw between His teeth, He begs all who cross his path, “Worship Lord Gaurahari and you will purchase me.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["eta boli’ nityānanda bhūme goḍi jāy","sonāra parvata jena dhūlāte loṭāy"],"translation":["Saying this Nityānanda falls to the ground, appearing like a golden mountain rolling in the dust."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["heno avatāre jāra rati nā janmilo","lochan bole sei pāpī elo āra gelo"],"translation":["Where attachment for such an incarnation has not arisen, Lochan Dās says that such a sinful person comes and goes in the cycle of repeated birth and death."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/20-akrodha-paramananda-nityananda-ray-6","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.K. Ashram Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scsmathcolombia/11-akrodha-paramananda","personSlug":"srila-b-k-ashram-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/acharya-maharaj-akrodha","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-akrodha","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/akrodha-paramananda","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/akrodha-paramananda/","description":"Akrodha paramānanda — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Akrodha paramānanda. by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"akrodha-paramananda"}}